    description: "Found by the 2026-10-31 docstring staleness audit (dev 5f6b2af921): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10312026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. rust.py:4072-4079: local_symbols.get(short) then resolver.lookup with no INV-fahub defer and no ffi exclusion. println!(\"{:?}\", Instant::now()) binds a same-file extern \"C\" fn now; a bare helper() in a macro binds another file's A::helper; both stay unresolved outside a macro. Related to but distinct from WI-hilib. v07."  # 87f2
